{"kiki|Mummy Prathyu! I am Kiki! Can I fly with you? Please, please!": "vo_00.mp3", "kiki|Yay! So much fun, Mummy! 💖": "vo_01.mp3", "kiki|Wheee! So much fun, Mummy!": "vo_02.mp3", "kiki|Mummy Prathyu, I love our colours! So pretty!": "vo_03.mp3", "kiki|Bye bye Mummy! See you soon!": "vo_04.mp3", "kiki|Hi Mummy Prathyu!": "vo_05.mp3", "prathyu|Hello Kiki! Look, we are both mermaids now!": "vo_06.mp3", "prathyu|Hello Kiki! Stay close to Mummy!": "vo_07.mp3", "prathyu|Bye Kiki! Mummy loves you!": "vo_08.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki! That is Mercury, the tiniest planet, very close to the Sun. It goes round the Sun in only eighty eight days!": "vo_09.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki! This is Venus, the hottest planet, wrapped in thick yellow clouds. And it spins the wrong way round!": "vo_10.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki, that is Earth, our home! The blue is water, and the little grey friend is our Moon.": "vo_11.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki! Mars is the red planet. It is rusty and dusty, and it has the tallest volcano of all!": "vo_12.mp3", "prathyu|Wow! Jupiter is the giant! It is so big that all the other planets could fit inside it. It has a great big storm too.": "vo_13.mp3", "prathyu|Beautiful! Saturn has beautiful rings made of ice and rocks. It is so light it could float in water!": "vo_14.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki! Uranus is icy blue and rolls around on its side, like a ball!": "vo_15.mp3", "prathyu|Look Kiki! Neptune is deep blue and very windy. It is the farthest planet from the Sun.": "vo_16.mp3", "prathyu|Wow, we are underwater now, Kiki! Look, a baby dolphin has come to swim with us! Swim through the glowing bubbles!": "vo_17.mp3", "prathyu|Back on land! Look Kiki, see the flowers and the trees? Butterflies love meadows like this.": "vo_18.mp3", "prathyu|Now we fly above the clouds and into space! Come, I will tell you about the planets as we pass them.": "vo_19.mp3", "angel|Welcome to Heaven, little unicorn! ✨": "vo_20.mp3", "angel|Goodbye, brave flyer! Come back soon 💫": "vo_21.mp3", "prathyu|Wow Kiki, this is the Candy Cloud Kingdom! Look at the lollipops and candy canes floating in the sky!": "vo_22.mp3", "prathyu|Do you see the gumdrops? They float like little jellies in the pink sky.": "vo_23.mp3", "prathyu|These soft pink clouds look like cotton candy. Let us fly through them together!": "vo_24.mp3", "prathyu|Brrr Kiki, this is the Snow Kingdom! Look at the tall ice towers and the shiny snowflakes floating in the sky!": "vo_25.mp3", "prathyu|See the green and blue ribbons of light in the sky? That is called an aurora. It is a beautiful dance of light.": "vo_26.mp3", "prathyu|Every snowflake has six arms, and no two snowflakes are exactly the same. Is that not wonderful?": "vo_27.mp3", "prathyu|Wow Kiki, this is the Rainforest of Butterflies! Look at the giant flowers and the big green leaves in the sky!": "vo_28.mp3", "prathyu|Butterflies drink sweet nectar from the flowers. They even taste it with their feet. Can you believe that?": "vo_29.mp3", "prathyu|A rainforest gets rain almost every day. That is why the leaves are so big and so green.": "vo_30.mp3", "prathyu|Shh Kiki, this is the Dream Garden at night. See how the flowers glow softly in the dark?": "vo_31.mp3", "prathyu|Those tiny lights are fireflies. They glow like little lanterns to say hello to each other.": "vo_32.mp3", "prathyu|The big moon and the twinkling stars are keeping watch over us. Let us fly gently now.": "vo_33.mp3", "ember|Hello Kiki! I am Ember, a baby dragon. Can I fly with you?": "vo_34.mp3", "ember|Whoosh! Flying is so much fun!": "vo_35.mp3", "fairy|Hello Prathyu! I am Flora, the fairy guide. Follow my sparkles!": "vo_36.mp3", "fairy|Look how pretty it is here! Keep flying, you are doing great!": "vo_37.mp3", "queen|Welcome, little ones. I am the Butterfly Queen. Thank you for visiting my forest.": "vo_38.mp3", "queen|Here is a gift of stars for you. Fly safe, my dears.": "vo_39.mp3", "prathyu|Come Kiki, it is bedtime. Let us fly very slowly under the stars, and listen to a little story.": "vo_40.mp3", "prathyu|Once upon a time, a little foal named Kiki and her mummy Prathyu loved to fly over the soft green meadow.": "vo_41.mp3", "prathyu|Every night the butterflies sang a quiet song, and all the flowers closed their petals to sleep.": "vo_42.mp3", "prathyu|The moon smiled, the stars twinkled, and Kiki closed her sleepy eyes. Goodnight, my sweet Kiki. Sweet dreams.": "vo_43.mp3", "prathyu|Chapter one, the Meadow. Prathyu woke up with the sun, and little Kiki asked, Mummy, can we fly today? Of course, my darling.": "vo_44.mp3", "prathyu|Chapter two, the Crystal Lake. Prathyu dived into the cool water and became a mermaid. Kiki giggled, and a baby dolphin swam beside them.": "vo_45.mp3", "prathyu|Chapter three, Sky and Space. Up above the clouds, the planets waved hello. Kiki counted them, one, two, three, all the way to eight.": "vo_46.mp3", "prathyu|Chapter four, the Candy Cloud Kingdom. The clouds were soft and pink like cotton candy, and the lollipops stood tall like trees.": "vo_47.mp3", "prathyu|Chapter five, the Snow Kingdom. The ice towers sparkled, and the aurora painted green and blue ribbons across the sky.": "vo_48.mp3", "prathyu|Chapter six, the Rainforest of Butterflies. A kind Butterfly Queen welcomed them, and gave Kiki a gift of shining stars.": "vo_49.mp3", "prathyu|Chapter seven, the Dream Garden. The flowers glowed, the fireflies danced, and the big moon sang a lullaby for little Kiki.": "vo_50.mp3"}